 "stimulus_html": "For the following exercises, read the following: <b>Fifteen-year mortgage compared to 30-year mortgage.</b> Mortgage interest rates are often higher for 30-year mortgages than 15-year mortgages. However, the payments for 15-year mortgages are considerably higher. The following exercises explore the difference between a 15- and 30-year mortgage for a mortgage of $100,000.",
 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 519671,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "The 15-year mortgage interest rate is 5.65%.\n<br>\n<ol type=\"a\">\n<li>Find the payment.</li>\n<li>Determine the total that would be paid if the mortgage was completed.</li>\n<li>Find the cost of financing for this mortgage.</li>\n</ol>",
   "answers": [],
